BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 288.00 Td (1. WHAT IS TXT2PDF?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 276.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 264.00 Td (txt2pdf is a zero-dependency command-line utility that converts plain text) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 252.00 Td (files into structured PDF 1.4 documents.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 228.00 Td (Unlike Pandoc, wkhtmltopdf, or Python-based converters that require hundreds) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 216.00 Td (of megabytes of runtime dependencies, txt2pdf is a small static binary.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 192.00 Td (It parses text, calculates page breaks, generates PDF objects, and writes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (the final binary stream directly to disk using only the C standard library.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 156.00 Td (It is designed for environments where installing dependencies is impossible,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 144.00 Td (unwanted, or where the network is down.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 120.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 108.00 Td (2. UPDATED PARSER RULES) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 96.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 84.00 Td (The parser creates PDF bookmarks only for lines that are real section) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 72.00 Td (headers.) Tj ET
endstream
