BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 780.00 Td (A line is considered a section header only if all of these conditions are) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 768.00 Td (true:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 744.00 Td (- It starts with a digit, optionally followed by letters, then a dot.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 732.00 Td (- The title text after the dot contains only uppercase letters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 720.00 Td (- The line is surrounded by separator lines made mostly of '=' characters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 708.00 Td (- The line is not inside a contents block.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 684.00 Td (Valid section shape:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 660.00 Td (- separator line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 648.00 Td (- uppercase numbered title) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 636.00 Td (- separator line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 612.00 Td (Rejected lines:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 588.00 Td (- numbered titles containing lowercase letters) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (- numbered titles used as examples inside normal paragraphs) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (- numbered titles not surrounded by separator lines) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (- numbered titles inside the contents block) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (This makes the parser much safer for manuals that contain examples.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (3. TABLE OF CONTENTS RULES ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (Internal links are created only from contents blocks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (A contents block is detected when:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (- a line contains the token "[TOC]" \(e.g., "[TOC]" or "[TOC] TABLE OF CONTENTS"\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 408.00 Td (- the next non-blank line is a separator line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (- the block ends at the next separator line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (Rules for entries:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 348.00 Td (- entries must be numbered lines) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (- lowercase entries are recommended) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 324.00 Td (- entries are not converted into bookmarks) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (- entries are linked to the matching section by number or title) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 300.00 Td (- uppercase entries inside the contents block are also ignored as bookmarks) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 276.00 Td (This means the old duplicate-bookmark problem is largely eliminated by the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 264.00 Td (parser itself.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 240.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
