BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 624.00 Td (A minimal compatible document needs three things:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 612.00 Td (- a contents block starting with the [TOC] token) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (- lowercase or mixed-case contents entries) Tj ET
