BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (Recommended structure:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (- write the contents title line containing [TOC] \(e.g., "[TOC] TABLE OF CONTENTS"\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 540.00 Td (- write a separator line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (- write entries such as "1. introduction" and "2. conclusion") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 516.00 Td (- write a separator line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (- for each section, write a separator line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (- write the uppercase header, for example "1. INTRODUCTION") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (- write another separator line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (- write the section body) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (Important:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (Do not wrap example headers with separator lines unless you want them to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (become real bookmarks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 384.00 Td (6. PDF INTERNALS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td (txt2pdf generates a valid PDF 1.4 structure from scratch.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (Catalog and Pages:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 324.00 Td (Calculates A4 dimensions, applies margins, wraps text using Courier 9pt) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (font with 12pt leading.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 288.00 Td (Encoding & Smart Decoder:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 276.00 Td (Auto-detects UTF-8 vs Latin-1. If UTF-8 is detected, a smart decoder ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 264.00 Td (translates multi-byte sequences to WinAnsiEncoding on the fly, ensuring ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 252.00 Td (perfect rendering of accents \(·ÈÌÛ˙\), Ò, ¸, and their uppercase variants.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 228.00 Td (Outlines:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 216.00 Td (Generates a linked list of PDF Outline objects pointing to the exact XYZ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 204.00 Td (coordinates of each uppercase header.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (Annotations:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 168.00 Td (Scans contents blocks and injects link annotations for each entry matching) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 156.00 Td (a real section.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 132.00 Td (Cross-Reference Table:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 120.00 Td (Calculates byte offsets for every object and writes a compliant xref table) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 108.00 Td (and trailer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 84.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
