BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 456.00 Td (Why musl?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (glibc static binaries are often much larger due to NSS and locale data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (musl provides a clean, minimal libc that results in a tiny, fully) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (self-contained executable.) Tj ET
