BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 516.00 Td (11. DESIGN PHILOSOPHY) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (Modern software development has forgotten how to build small tools.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (We wrap simple text transformations in Electron apps, Node.js runtimes,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (and Docker containers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (txt2pdf is a rejection of that bloat.) Tj ET
